Key Advantages of This Version

Residual learning → much more stable when differences (X–Y) vary a lot.
Multi-channel 1D CNN → efficiently handles long vectors (500–3000) and injects parameters P everywhere.
Memory efficient compared to fully connected networks.

Tips for Best Performance

Start with fewer epochs (200–300) and monitor validation loss.
If overfitting → add dropoutLayer(0.1) after some ReLU layers.
Very long vectors (>2000) → increase pooling or add another downsampling stage.
GPU strongly recommended.

